WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.222 --> 00:00:13.040
[MUSIC]

2
00:00:20.844 --> 00:00:23.172
In this module we're
going to get technical,

3
00:00:23.172 --> 00:00:26.348
as we teach you about the mechanics
behind the options market.

4
00:00:26.348 --> 00:00:30.459
Some investors may be satisfied knowing
that call options are associated

5
00:00:30.459 --> 00:00:31.662
with rising prices.

6
00:00:31.662 --> 00:00:35.710
And that put options are associated
with falling prices.

7
00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.014
But behind the scenes there's a lot
going on with how option prices move.

8
00:00:40.014 --> 00:00:44.867
We'll start the module with a note about
some algebraic logic behind options

9
00:00:44.867 --> 00:00:46.817
known as, put/call parity.

10
00:00:46.817 --> 00:00:49.738
And then we're going to take
a deep dive into what factors

11
00:00:49.738 --> 00:00:52.610
are important in determining
the price of an option.

12
00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:56.875
We'll also help you visualize the payout
of an option trade with respect to

13
00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:58.917
the price of the underlying asset.

14
00:00:58.917 --> 00:00:59.874
And finally,

15
00:00:59.874 --> 00:01:04.911
we'll walk you through a series of
risk variables known as option Greeks.

16
00:01:04.911 --> 00:01:10.666
These values are important since they tell
investors how much or how little the value

17
00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:16.275
of an option will change with respect to
changes in price, time, or volatility.

18
00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:17.889
Let's get started.

19
00:01:17.889 --> 00:01:21.466
[MUSIC]